      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. NUMBER SYSTEM – BASIC CONCEPT"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Understanding basic concepts and types of numbers forms the foundation of the Number System.",
        "Important properties of numbers are crucial for SSC exam preparation.",
        "Divisibility rules are a frequently asked topic in competitive exams.",
        "Mastery of factors and multiples is essential for solving quantitative aptitude problems."
      ],
      "id": "59g9mde"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mfxij2a",
      "content": "Number System deals with classification and properties of numbers used in calculations.<br></br><br></br>In SSC examination, questions from Number System are:<br></br>• Basic<br></br>• Concept-based<br></br>• Usually one or two steps only"
    },
