    {
      "id": "0go625c",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2. IMPORTANT PROPERTIES (VERY IMPORTANT FOR SSC)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a0ms41b",
      "content": "Even and Odd Numbers:<br></br>• Even + Even = Even<br></br>• Odd + Odd = Even<br></br>• Even + Odd = Odd<br></br>• Even × Odd = Even<br></br>• Odd × Odd = Odd<br></br><br></br>Prime Numbers:<br></br>• 2 is the only even prime number<br></br>• 1 is neither prime nor composite<br></br>• Every composite number can be expressed as a product of prime numbers"
    },
    {
      "id": "ww97zvg",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. DIVISIBILITY RULES (FREQUENTLY ASKED)"
